<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 77,000 MT slid 53 percent below the prior week and 60 percent below the 4-week average.  Major increases for Canada (18,600 MT), Guatemala (16,600 MT), Algeria (15,000 MT), and the Dominican Republic (10,800 MT) were partially offset by reductions for unknown destinations (6,000 MT) and China (4,500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 78,600 MT were off 19 percent from the previous week and 39 percent from the 4-week average.  China (39,500 MT), Canada (14,800 MT), and Venezuela (7,300 MT) were the major destinations.</p>
</text>
